            "review_title": "Review at Fresh Flavas Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Msiisav\nLondon, United Kingdom94 contributions\n0\nInviting Smiles & Inviting Meal with Inviting Atmosphere\nDec 2018 • Couples\nFresh Flavas Restaurant, may not look all that inviting from the outside, but step inside (Located under The Little Hanoi Diamond Hotel) and you’ll be greeted with big smiles from this family fun place (NB the owner speaks very good English). The menu is broader than expected too, and the food tastes great. Highly recommend this little diamond!\nWritten December 15, 2018",
